      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "RICHARD.\n[Aside.] I’ll blast his harvest, if your head were laid;\nFor yet I am not looked on in the world.\nThis shoulder was ordained so thick to heave,\nAnd heave it shall some weight or break my back.\nWork thou the way, and that shall execute.",
