    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.7/p@195915",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "RICHARD.\nAnd, that I love the tree from whence thou sprang’st,\nWitness the loving kiss I give the fruit.\n[Aside.] To say the truth, so Judas kissed his master\nAnd cried “All hail!” when as he meant all harm.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
